## 📋 Overview

This is a production-ready C++ driver library for the **{{PART_NAME}}** sensor/device. The library provides a clean, modular API with clear separation of concerns:

- **Register Definitions** (`{{part}}_regs.h`): Single source of truth for all hardware registers
- **Main Logic** (`{{part}}.cpp`): Business logic and high-level API
- **Hardware Abstraction** (`{{part}}_hal.cpp`): Platform-specific I2C implementation
- **Documentation**: Every register and bitfield includes datasheet page references

### Key Features

- ✅ Modular architecture (lexus2k/ssd1306 style)
- ✅ Platform support: Arduino (Wire), Bare-metal (user-provided I2C)
- ✅ Datasheet-referenced code (every definition cites page numbers)
- ✅ Type-safe enumerations for configuration values
- ✅ Comprehensive error handling
- ✅ Efficient burst read operations
- ✅ Example sketches included

