## 🔌 Hardware Connections

### Typical Wiring (Arduino)

```
{{PART_NAME}}     Arduino Uno/Nano     Arduino Mega/Due
---------     ----------------     ----------------
VCC           3.3V or 5V*          3.3V or 5V*
GND           GND                  GND
SDA           A4                   SDA (Pin 20)
SCL           A5                   SCL (Pin 21)
{{OPTIONAL_PINS_WIRING}}
```

**\* Check datasheet for voltage requirements:** {{VCC_RANGE}}

### I2C Pull-up Resistors

- Required: 4.7kΩ pull-ups on SDA and SCL lines
- Most Arduino boards have built-in pull-ups
- For long cables or multiple devices, external pull-ups recommended

### I2C Address

- **Default Address**: `0x{{I2C_ADDRESS}}` (7-bit)
- {{ADDRESS_CONFIG_NOTE}}

