## 📚 API Reference

### Initialization

#### `{{Part}}(uint8_t addr = {{PART_UPPER}}_I2C_ADDR)`
Constructor. Optionally specify custom I2C address.

```cpp
{{Part}} sensor;              // Use default address
{{Part}} sensor(0x{{ALT_ADDR}});  // Use alternate address
```

#### `bool begin()`
Initialize device. Returns `true` on success.

```cpp
if (!sensor.begin()) {
    Serial.println("Init failed!");
}
```

**What it does:**
1. Verify I2C communication (read WHO_AM_I register)
2. Perform soft reset
3. Apply default configuration

**Datasheet Reference:** p.{{PAGE}}, §{{SECTION}}

